This crate (`symphonia-codec-truehd`) is a pure-Rust decoder for Dolby TrueHD and Meridian
Lossless Packing (MLP). Its bitstream parsing and decoding algorithms are a function-by-function
port of the MLP/TrueHD decoder in FFmpeg (release n9.0.2, https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg):

  libavcodec/mlpdec.c     (major sync / restart header / decoding parameter / block parsing,
                           FIR+IIR filtering, rematrixing, noise generation, output packing)
  libavcodec/mlp_parse.c  (major sync header parsing, channel layout selection)
  libavcodec/mlp.c        (CRC and parity helpers, Huffman codebooks, noise table)
  libavcodec/mlpdsp.c     (filter and rematrix reference behaviour)
  libavutil/crc.c         (CRC-8/CRC-16 polynomial conventions)

The Huffman code tables (`HUFFMAN_CODES`) and the noise table (`NOISE_TABLE`) in `src/tables.rs`
were extracted programmatically from `libavcodec/mlp.c` / `libavcodec/mlpdec.c`; they are not
retyped.

